Package: plib1
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Depends: glutg3, libgl1
Replaces: plib
Conflicts: plib
Description: Portability Libraries: Run-time package.
 Provides a Joystick interface, a simple GUI built on top of OpenGL,
 some standard geometry functions, a sound library and a simple scene
 graph API built on top of OpenGL.
 .
 This package contains the shared libraries need at runtime.

Package: plib-dev
Section: devel
Architecture: any
Depends: plib1, glutg3-dev, libgl-dev
Description: Portability Libraries: Development package.
 Provides a Joystick interface, a simple GUI built on top of OpenGL,
 some standard geometry functions, a sound library and a simple scene
 graph API built on top of OpenGL.
 .
 This package contains the header files and the static libraries needed
 for development.
